BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (  This is the first round of a trust game where I'm the sender. Let me think through the strateg) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (    ic considerations:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
